  "0 = tanpa garansi.": "0 = no warranty.",
  "<strong>Identitas:</strong> isi <strong>SKU</strong> (kode unik, wajib) dan <strong>Nama Produk</strong> (wajib). <i>No. Produk</i> terisi otomatis (PRD-xxxxx); <i>Barcode</i> opsional.": "<strong>Identity:</strong> enter the <strong>SKU</strong> (unique code, required) and <strong>Product Name</strong> (required). <i>Product No.</i> is filled automatically (PRD-xxxxx); <i>Barcode</i> is optional.",
  "<strong>Klasifikasi:</strong> pilih <strong>Category & Brand</strong> (opsional), <strong>Jenis Produk</strong> (wajib), dan <i>Unit</i> - satuan dasar produk (wajib). Satuan lain & konversinya diatur nanti lewat menu <i>Satuan Produk</i>.": "<strong>Classification:</strong> select <strong>Category & Brand</strong> (optional), <strong>Product Type</strong> (required), and <i>Unit</i> - the product's base unit (required). Other units & their conversions are set later via the <i>Product Units</i> menu.",
  "<strong>Lain-lain:</strong> <i>Deskripsi & Gambar</i> opsional. Sakelar: <strong>Track Stock</strong> (pantau stok), <strong>Lacak Serial</strong> (tiap unit discan nomor serial saat penerimaan), <strong>Aktif</strong>. <strong>Garansi (bulan)</strong> berlaku untuk produk ber-serial (dihitung sejak terjual).": "<strong>Other:</strong> <i>Description & Image</i> are optional. Switches: <strong>Track Stock</strong> (monitor stock), <strong>Track Serial</strong> (each unit's serial number is scanned on receipt), <strong>Active</strong>. <strong>Warranty (months)</strong> applies to serialized products (counted from the sale date).",
  "<strong>Mode Dimensi</strong> menentukan cara Qty dihitung di transaksi: pilih <strong>&quot;Tidak&quot;</strong> bila qty = jumlah satuan (mis. Pcs/Lembar); pilih <strong>Panjang/Luas/Volume</strong> bila qty dihitung dari dimensi (mis. busa/kain). Bila dimensional, isi <i>Dimensi per satuan (cm)</i> sebagai nilai default.": "<strong>Dimension Mode</strong> determines how Qty is calculated in transactions: choose <strong>&quot;No&quot;</strong> when qty = number of units (e.g. Pcs/Sheet); choose <strong>Length/Area/Volume</strong> when qty is calculated from dimensions (e.g. foam/fabric). If dimensional, fill in <i>Dimensions per unit (cm)</i> as the default values.",
  "<strong>Mode Harga: &quot;Harga tetap&quot;</strong> → isi <strong>Harga Beli & Harga Jual</strong> langsung. <strong>&quot;Per kubikasi&quot;</strong> → isi <strong>Tarif Beli/Jual per m³</strong> + dimensi (P×L×T); harga per satuan dihitung otomatis (Beli/Jual jadi read-only). <strong>Min Stock</strong> opsional (peringatan stok menipis).": "<strong>Price Mode: &quot;Fixed price&quot;</strong> → enter the <strong>Cost Price & Selling Price</strong> directly. <strong>&quot;Per cubic volume&quot;</strong> → enter the <strong>Cost/Selling Rate per m³</strong> + dimensions (L×W×H); the unit price is calculated automatically (Cost/Selling become read-only). <strong>Min Stock</strong> is optional (low-stock warning).",
